ing you do affects your park\u2019s overall rating from how clean it is, to how fun your slides are, to the quality of your food and amenities. The happier your guests are, the better your rating. Keep them satisfied and they\u2019ll stay longer, spend more, and want to come back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/f61e509a73e5c6770fc343482e718bc7.avif?t=1755484976\" data-has-big width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/66f6930bb18960413fbc2cb692f67d08.poster.avif?t=1755484976\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/66f6930bb18960413fbc2cb692f67d08.webm?t=1755484976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/66f6930bb18960413fbc2cb692f67d08.mp4?t=1755484976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your park gets more popular, it\u2019s time to expand. Unlock new areas to grow your waterpark\u2019s size and hire staff to handle the daily chaos. With a team in place, you can focus on what really matters\u2014building the best waterpark possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/3c9ab741def5e226068d892ee3717d63.poster.avif?t=1755484976\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/3c9ab741def5e226068d892ee3717d63.webm?t=1755484976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/123779798358f650512ddf6c20eb9e47.poster.avif?t=1755484976\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293260/extras/123779798358f650512ddf6c20eb9e47.webm?t=1755484976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
